<title>UK: Ford Motor Credit sets $200 mln 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Ford Motor Credit sets $200 mln 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD MOTOR CREDIT CO</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    03.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.815   PAY DATE    03.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.665    SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC   1.15</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
